catalog live_capacity 1.
% the live workspace's capacity (the redesign's W4, notes/step3-cognition-live.md): the devices and the cognition
% under one director, the planner attention. The cognition's types as its home workspace names them, but its tasks
% are slots (k1..k8): a slot's words are the host's ledger, as the agenda keeps an event's summary outside the rules.
type task {k1 k2 k3 k4 k5 k6 k7 k8}.
include "shared/home_map.llp".   % the home's map and the members (the domain type): generated, nina-live world/gen_map.py
type plan {original simple}.
type channel {hall direct group}.
type encounter {home_visit}.
type message {home_question}.
type participant {resident visitor}.
type slot {first_slot revised_slot}.
type reference {public_link}.
type source_record {local_report original_report}.
type asset {personal_photo}.
type contribution {contributor}.
